        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the third quarter of 2025, we bolstered our Commercial consulting offerings through the acquisitions of TVG-Treliant Holdings, LLC (“Treliant”), a global financial services consulting and managed services firm, and Wilson Perumal and Company, Inc.",
        "start_character": 8217,
